organ analyst Anatol Feygin, who downgraded Enron to "long-term buy" and ow=
ns no shares.=20
Fastow, 39, ran LJM Cayman and LJM2 Co-Investment, two partnerships created=
 by Enron to buy company assets. Enron's involvement in the financing vehic=
les cost the company $35 million in third-quarter losses.=20
