Sorry.  I got the message, but I've been running for the last week.  The divorce is almost final....I am DIVORCED !!!! YEAAAAAHHH.

I WON SOLE CUSTODY OF THE GIRLS ....YEAAAHHH.

But since Reggie is representing himself, after three hours, we ran out of time.  So we will resume the trial on 10/25, and we will argue over the value of the house, the stuff in the house, and decide how much I have to pay him.  You know I have every little receipt I could find so that it reduces this amount.  But, the final decision on division of the home is up to the judge.  The child support amount will be determined too.

It really doesn't matter, the judge wants the kids to be in the house, and the most important thing, is that I will make all parenting decisions with regard to the children.

Since then, it's been crazy at work, then I was on the program committee for the annual conference of a professional organization that I belong to.  The meeting was here in Chicago, so I spent the weekend and Mon and Tues. socializing with that group.

My "church" girlfriend stook me out for drinks last Friday, and I've been partying ever since.  Patrice, I didn't know how much of a burden that man was to me until that judge said "your divorced effective immediately".
I haven't been this happy since I was in college.

And guess what.....don't tell anyone, I haven't even told my sister or mother this....my yoga instructor asked me for my phone number on Saturday, and actually called me Sunday.  He's 41, divorced , has an undergraduate degree in biology and has the tightest ass you've ever seen.  But, he's short and has a gold tooth.....(and he probably really likes white girls).

that's enough for now.  I got to get some work done.  Talk with you soon.  Robyn

