calendar when I get home.  I am interviewing that week and some are
scheduled in hotel and some are on my end of town; didn't bring my schedule
for that with me.  We are in meetings from 9-5:30pm so now I see what it
must be like on your business trips!! Did spend an evening with my aunt and
cousins on Sunday and one of my first cousins is taking me around tonite for
a while.  Last nite I went on a twilight tour until 11:30.  The monuments
