we are in Chicago.  I know your schedule just got alot more hectic, so let
me know.  They can stay in Conroe on Fri and Sat.  We leave Wed night and
return Sun morning.  It would mean be staying at our house on those nights
and getting them to school.  If you can't, we will try to get one of the
neighbors.

Thanks.  See you when you get back.

DG

