The Dow Chemical Co., Conoco Inc., Motiva Enterprises, Occidental Petroleum, 
Equilon Enterprises, Phillips Petroleum, Mitsubishi Corp., Repsol, YPF, 
Statoil, Unocal and Tosco. 
