These are my questions for Dominion.  I've revised these several times but I decided to keep it simple and just lump everything into the Appalachian Producer question #1.  FYI  I would guess that over 90% of our trading activity (excluding the VNG asset management deal) was at the pool, contract #T00015.

I finally found the EES invoices last Friday so that answered most of my capacity release questions.



Questions for Dominion

Appalachian Producers

1.	How are production meters added to a shipper's pool (what forms are required)?
2.	Are the procedures in item 1 in the tariff?  If yes, where?
3.	How are production meters removed from a shipper's pool?
4.	By contract, how would ENA nominate the gas from the production meter to the Title Transfer Pool (contract #T00015)?



Capacity Release / Contracts

