	From:  Susan Scott                           03/10/2000 04:14 PM
	

To: Drew Fossum@ENRON, Mary Kay Miller/ET&S/Enron@ENRON, Glen 
Hass/ET&S/Enron@ENRON, sstojic@gbmdc.com
